      "text": "YouTube\n\nYoutube is a video-sharing platform that allows users to upload, view, and interact with video content.\nAs of this video, it is the second most visited website in the world.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "YouTube\n\nYoutube is a video-sharing platform that allows users to upload, view, and interact with video content.\nAs of this video, it is the second most visited website in the world.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
